The demo canvas painter (demo/page.ts: graphMetrics, maxPosition, paintArrow,
paintEdge, paintNode, paintRow) is adapted from GitNut, which ports
IntelliJ's SimpleGraphCellPainter:

  GitNut by Flying Art (https://github.com/flyingart/gitnut)
  packages/commons/src/graph/paint.ts
  packages/client/src/graph/canvas.ts
  packages/client/src/CommitGraph.tsx

Copyright 2026 Flying Art (https://flyingart.dev).
